{"uid":"sn1.16","title":"Sleepiness and Sloth","reference":"Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.16","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["“Sleepiness, sloth, and yawning,","discontent, and grogginess after eating:","because of this the noble path","doesn’t shine for creatures here.”","“Sleepiness, sloth, and yawning,","discontent, and grogginess after eating:","when this is energetically fended off,","the noble path is purified.”"]}]}
